{"id":"u50","kelas":"kerja","no":3,"judul":"Permintaan dan Tawaran yang Sopan","title":"Polite Requests and Offers","emoji":"🙏","ringkas":"Could/would/may, meminta tolong, menolak dengan sopan","ready":true,"goals":["meminta tolong dengan sopan: [[Could you ...?]], [[Would you mind ...ing?]], [[I was wondering if ...]]","menawarkan bantuan: [[Shall I ...?]], [[Would you like me to ...?]], [[Can I help you with ...?]]","menerima dan menolak permintaan dengan sopan","membedakan tingkat **kesopanan**: santai, netral, dan sangat formal","memakai **pertanyaan tidak langsung** ([[Could you tell me where ...?]])","mengucapkan terima kasih dan menanggapinya"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di tempat kerja, **cara kita meminta** sering lebih penting daripada **apa yang diminta**. Kalimat seperti *Give me the file* terdengar kasar. Dengan *Could you send me the file, please?* permintaan yang sama terdengar sopan dan profesional."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Tingkat kesopanan permintaan","table":[["Tingkat","Ungkapan","Contoh"],["Santai","[[Can you ...?]]","[[Can you pass me that pen?]]"],["Sopan","[[Could you ...?]]","[[Could you send me the report?]]"],["Lebih sopan","[[Would you mind + V-ing?]]","[[Would you mind closing the door?]]"],["Sangat formal","[[I was wondering if you could ...]]","[[I was wondering if you could help me with this.]]"],["Izin","[[May I ...?]] / [[Could I ...?]]","[[May I use your phone?]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Would you mind + V-ing","text":"Setelah [[Would you mind]] pakai **V-ing**: [[Would you mind waiting?]] Untuk setuju, jawab [[Not at all.]] atau [[Of course not.]] (artinya *tidak keberatan*). Jawab [[I'm sorry, I do mind.]] hanya jika menolak."},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Menawarkan bantuan","table":[["Ungkapan","Contoh"],["[[Can I help you with ...?]]","[[Can I help you with the printer?]]"],["[[Shall I + V1?]]","[[Shall I open the window?]]"],["[[Would you like me to + V1?]]","[[Would you like me to book a room?]]"],["[[Let me + V1.]]","[[Let me carry that for you.]]"],["[[I'll + V1 if you like.]]","[[I'll send it if you like.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Menerima dan menolak","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menerima","[[Certainly.]] / [[Of course.]] / [[Sure, no problem.]] / [[I'd be happy to.]]"],["Menerima tawaran","[[Yes, please.]] / [[That would be great, thank you.]]"],["Menolak tawaran","[[No, thank you. I can manage.]] / [[That's very kind, but I'm fine.]]"],["Menolak permintaan","[[I'm afraid I can't. I have a deadline.]] / [[I'm sorry, but I'm not available.]]"],["Menawarkan alternatif","[[I can't today, but I could do it tomorrow.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"request","id":"permintaan","ex":"I have a small request."},{"en":"favour","id":"bantuan / kebaikan","ex":"Could I ask you a favour?"},{"en":"assist","id":"membantu","ex":"How may I assist you?"},{"en":"available","id":"tersedia","ex":"Are you available this afternoon?"},{"en":"manage","id":"mampu mengatasi","ex":"I can manage, thanks."},{"en":"mind","id":"keberatan","ex":"Do you mind waiting?"},{"en":"borrow","id":"meminjam","ex":"May I borrow your charger?"},{"en":"lend","id":"meminjamkan","ex":"Could you lend me a pen?"},{"en":"forward","id":"meneruskan","ex":"Please forward the email."},{"en":"remind","id":"mengingatkan","ex":"Could you remind me tomorrow?"},{"en":"appreciate","id":"menghargai","ex":"I really appreciate your help."},{"en":"in advance","id":"sebelumnya","ex":"Thank you in advance."},{"en":"otherwise","id":"kalau tidak","ex":"Please reply today, otherwise we will cancel."},{"en":"urgent","id":"mendesak","ex":"This is urgent."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Pertanyaan tidak langsung (lebih sopan)","table":[["Langsung","Tidak langsung (lebih sopan)"],["Where is the manager's office?","[[Could you tell me where the manager's office is?]]"],["What time does the meeting start?","[[Do you know what time the meeting starts?]]"],["How much is this?","[[Could you tell me how much this is?]]"],["Is he available?","[[I wonder if he is available.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Urutan kata pada pertanyaan tidak langsung","text":"Setelah pembuka sopan, urutan kembali seperti **kalimat biasa** dan tanpa do/does/did: [[Could you tell me where he **works**?]] (bukan *where does he work*)."},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Berterima kasih dan menanggapinya","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you very much.]] / [[I really appreciate it.]] / [[Thanks in advance.]]"],["Menanggapi","[[You're welcome.]] / [[No problem.]] / [[My pleasure.]] / [[Anytime.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Meminta tolong","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Excuse me, Tom. Could you help me with the printer? It isn't working.","id":"Permisi, Tom. Bisakah kamu membantuku dengan printer? Printernya tidak berfungsi."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Of course. Let me have a look. Would you mind waiting a moment?","id":"Tentu. Biar kulihat. Apakah kamu keberatan menunggu sebentar?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Not at all. I really appreciate your help.","id":"Sama sekali tidak. Aku sangat menghargai bantuanmu."},{"who":"Tom","en":"No problem. It's working now.","id":"Tidak masalah. Sekarang sudah berfungsi."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Menolak dengan sopan","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Dina, could you prepare the slides for tomorrow's meeting?","id":"Dina, bisakah kamu menyiapkan slide untuk rapat besok?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"I'm afraid I can't today because I'm finishing the sales report. But I could do it tomorrow morning.","id":"Sayangnya hari ini saya tidak bisa karena sedang menyelesaikan laporan penjualan. Tapi saya bisa mengerjakannya besok pagi."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Hmm. The meeting is at ten. Would you like me to ask Tom to help you?","id":"Hmm. Rapatnya pukul sepuluh. Mau saya minta Tom membantumu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"That would be great, thank you.","id":"Itu bagus sekali, terima kasih."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Permintaan: [[Can you]] (santai) → [[Could you]] (sopan) → [[Would you mind ...ing]] (lebih sopan) → [[I was wondering if ...]] (formal).","Tawaran: [[Shall I ...?]], [[Would you like me to ...?]], [[Let me ...]]","Menolak: [[I'm afraid I can't ...]] + alasan + alternatif.","Tidak langsung: [[Could you tell me where ... is?]], urutan seperti kalimat biasa."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan ungkapan dengan tingkat kesopanannya:","pairs":[["Can you pass it?","santai"],["Could you pass it?","sopan"],["Would you mind passing it?","lebih sopan"],["I was wondering if you could pass it.","sangat formal"]],"exp":"Tingkat kesopanan.","k":"89aed602"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["request","permintaan"],["favour","bantuan"],["appreciate","menghargai"],["urgent","mendesak"],["remind","mengingatkan"]],"exp":"Kosakata permintaan.","k":"d43c2b24"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan permintaan dengan tanggapan:","pairs":[["Could you help me?","Of course."],["Shall I open the window?","Yes, please."],["Would you mind waiting?","Not at all."],["Can I help you?","No, thank you. I can manage."]],"exp":"Tanggapan yang sesuai.","k":"ed680087"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang paling sopan?","options":["I was wondering if you could help me.","Help me.","You help me now.","Can you help me?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Paling formal.","k":"c83b6e96"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Setelah \"Would you mind\" kata kerja berbentuk...","options":["V-ing","V1","to V1","V3"],"answer":0,"exp":"Would you mind + V-ing.","k":"f708080f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban \"Not at all\" untuk \"Would you mind waiting?\" berarti...","options":["tidak keberatan","sangat keberatan","tidak mengerti","terima kasih kembali"],"answer":0,"exp":"Not at all = tidak keberatan.","k":"d904d474"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menawarkan bantuan yang sopan adalah...","options":["Would you like me to carry that?","Give it to me.","Carry it yourself.","I carry it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Would you like me to ...","k":"43be2655"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menolak permintaan dengan sopan adalah...","options":["I'm afraid I can't today, but I could do it tomorrow.","No way.","Not my job.","Never."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menolak + alternatif.","k":"ce7112e6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tanggapan untuk \"Thank you very much\" adalah...","options":["You're welcome.","I'm sorry.","Excuse me.","Goodbye."],"answer":0,"exp":"You're welcome.","k":"83cb6376"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pertanyaan tidak langsung yang benar adalah...","options":["Could you tell me where the office is?","Could you tell me where is the office?","Could you tell me where does the office is?","Could you tell me the office where?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Urutan kalimat biasa.","k":"3401364f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pertanyaan tidak langsung yang benar adalah...","options":["Do you know what time the meeting starts?","Do you know what time does the meeting start?","Do you know what time starts the meeting?","Do you know the meeting what time starts?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tanpa does setelah wh-word.","k":"832bb333"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan mana yang sebaiknya dipakai kepada atasan?","options":["Could you please review this?","Check this.","Look at this now.","You review it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"6f1674c5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah Anda membantu saya?","q":"___ you help me, please?","answers":["could","Could","can","Can","would","Would"],"hint":"modal","exp":"Could you ...?","k":"7f82c932"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah Anda keberatan menunggu?","q":"Would you mind ___? (wait)","answers":["waiting"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"mind + V-ing.","k":"a5e1e263"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mau saya bukakan jendela?","q":"___ I open the window?","answers":["shall","Shall"],"hint":"menawarkan","exp":"Shall I ...?","k":"b1f39f8b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf, saya tidak bisa hari ini.","q":"I'm ___ I can't today.","answers":["afraid","sorry"],"hint":"maaf","exp":"I'm afraid ...","k":"221253bf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas bantuanmu.","q":"I really ___ your help.","answers":["appreciate"],"hint":"menghargai","exp":"appreciate.","k":"ca1cd04f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tidak masalah.","q":"No ___.","answers":["problem"],"hint":"masalah","exp":"No problem.","k":"42029751"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Bisakah Anda mengirimkan laporan itu?\"","answer":"Could you send me the report?","exp":"Could you + V1?","k":"bd516caa"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Apakah Anda keberatan menutup pintu?\"","answer":"Would you mind closing the door?","exp":"Would you mind + V-ing?","k":"a05ee597"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Could you send me the report please","options":["Bisakah kamu mengirimkan laporan itu","Aku mengirim laporan","Laporan sudah dikirim","Laporan itu hilang"],"answer":0,"exp":"Could you ...","k":"09eb3315"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Would you mind waiting a moment","options":["Apakah Anda keberatan menunggu sebentar","Tolong tunggu di luar","Aku tidak mau menunggu","Saya sudah menunggu"],"answer":0,"exp":"Would you mind.","k":"baf2fc6e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I am afraid I cannot today","options":["Maaf, saya tidak bisa hari ini","Saya takut hari ini","Saya bisa hari ini","Saya pergi hari ini"],"answer":0,"exp":"I'm afraid.","k":"7023a89d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bolehkah saya bertanya sesuatu?","q":"___ I ask you something?","answers":["may","May","could","Could","can","Can"],"hint":"izin","exp":"May I ...?","k":"519c8c58"},{"type":"fill","id":"Biar saya yang membawa itu.","q":"___ me carry that.","answers":["let","Let"],"hint":"biar","exp":"Let me + V1.","k":"2c5be47f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mau saya pesankan taksi?","q":"Would you like me ___ book a taxi?","answers":["to"],"hint":"to","exp":"like me to + V1.","k":"67355fc2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dengan senang hati.","q":"I'd be ___ to.","answers":["happy","glad","pleased"],"hint":"senang","exp":"happy to.","k":"d11f72c1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Itu baik sekali, tapi saya baik-baik saja.","q":"That's very ___, but I'm fine.","answers":["kind"],"hint":"baik","exp":"very kind.","k":"fd9bd877"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah Anda mengulang itu?","q":"Could you ___ that, please? (repeat)","answers":["repeat"],"hint":"mengulang","exp":"Could you + V1.","k":"ab0e5f3a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon teruskan email ini.","q":"Please ___ this email.","answers":["forward"],"hint":"meneruskan","exp":"forward.","k":"7e9d08f7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah saya minta tolong sedikit?","q":"Could I ask you a ___?","answers":["favour","favor"],"hint":"bantuan","exp":"ask a favour.","k":"81b2f005"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini mendesak.","q":"This is ___.","answers":["urgent"],"hint":"mendesak","exp":"urgent.","k":"31a06994"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tolong balas hari ini, kalau tidak kami batalkan.","q":"Please reply today, ___ we will cancel.","answers":["otherwise"],"hint":"kalau tidak","exp":"otherwise.","k":"d129058a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah Anda tahu jam berapa rapat dimulai?","q":"Do you know what time the meeting ___? (start)","answers":["starts"],"hint":"he/it + s","exp":"Urutan kalimat biasa.","k":"b2721eee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang paling sopan untuk meminta bantuan?","options":["Would you mind helping me with this?","Help me with this.","You help.","Do it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"3b348384"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tanggapan untuk \"Thanks a lot\" adalah...","options":["My pleasure.","Sorry.","Goodbye.","Excuse me."],"answer":0,"exp":"My pleasure.","k":"49feee7b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["Could you tell me where the toilet is?","Could you tell me where is the toilet?","Could you tell me where does the toilet is?","Could you tell where the toilet?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Urutan biasa.","k":"13e1b91e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menawarkan bantuan?","options":["Can I help you with that?","Can you help me with that?","I help with that.","Who helps?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Can I help you ...","k":"d5c0ea79"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang meminta bantuan?","options":["Could you help me with that?","Shall I help you?","Let me help.","I'll help you."],"answer":0,"exp":"Could you ...","k":"2baa5f0a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menolak sopan?","options":["I'm sorry, but I'm not available then.","I won't.","Forget it.","Impossible."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"78d08bab"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyetujui permintaan?","options":["Certainly. I'll do it right away.","I'm afraid not.","No way.","Maybe never."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menyetujui.","k":"94e7c1f1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"May I borrow your charger?\" artinya...","options":["Bolehkah saya meminjam pengisi dayamu","Aku akan membelikan pengisi daya","Pengisi dayamu rusak","Aku punya pengisi daya"],"answer":0,"exp":"borrow = meminjam.","k":"b28918e7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Could you lend me a pen?\" artinya...","options":["Bisakah kamu meminjamkan pulpen","Bisakah aku meminjam pulpenmu","Aku beli pulpen","Pulpenku hilang"],"answer":0,"exp":"lend = meminjamkan.","k":"68d6ce4d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang sapaan layanan formal?","options":["How may I assist you?","What do you want?","Yes?","Hurry up."],"answer":0,"exp":"Layanan formal.","k":"edac79e6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang sebaiknya dihindari kepada atasan?","options":["Give me the file now.","Could you send me the file?","May I have the file?","Would you mind sending the file?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terlalu kasar.","k":"0b1d0a4d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I wonder if he is available.","I wonder if is he available.","I wonder if does he available.","I wonder he is if available."],"answer":0,"exp":"Urutan biasa.","k":"72bfacfd"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Maaf, saya tidak bisa hari ini.\"","answer":"I'm afraid I can't today.","exp":"I'm afraid + klausa.","k":"cbe70406"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan permintaan dengan penolakan sopan:","pairs":[["Can you work tonight?","I'm afraid I'm busy tonight."],["Could you lend me money?","I'm sorry, I can't."],["Would you mind staying late?","I'm afraid I do mind."],["May I use your desk?","I'd rather you didn't."]],"exp":"Menolak sopan.","k":"b6685889"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Would you like me to book a room","options":["Mau saya pesankan ruangan","Aku sudah memesan ruangan","Ruangan itu penuh","Tolong pesan kopi"],"answer":0,"exp":"Would you like me to.","k":"004bac55"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I really appreciate your help","options":["Saya sangat menghargai bantuanmu","Aku tidak butuh bantuan","Bantuanmu terlambat","Aku lupa kamu"],"answer":0,"exp":"appreciate.","k":"a841f22e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah Anda keberatan jika saya membuka jendela?","q":"Do you ___ if I open the window?","answers":["mind"],"hint":"keberatan","exp":"mind.","k":"19da4d42"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maukah Anda teh?","q":"Would you ___ some tea?","answers":["like"],"hint":"ingin","exp":"Would you like.","k":"6f498f85"},{"type":"fill","id":"Izinkan saya membawakan tas Anda.","q":"Let me ___ your bag.","answers":["carry"],"hint":"membawa","exp":"carry.","k":"939fb1e4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan sangat berterima kasih jika Anda dapat mengirimnya.","q":"I would be grateful if you ___ send it.","answers":["could"],"hint":"dapat","exp":"could.","k":"f097b5a2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf, bolehkah saya meminjam pulpen Anda?","q":"Excuse me, may I ___ your pen?","answers":["borrow"],"hint":"meminjam","exp":"borrow.","k":"7b24a86f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dengan senang hati.","q":"With ___.","answers":["pleasure"],"hint":"senang","exp":"With pleasure.","k":"d06bb1c2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tentu, tidak masalah.","q":"Sure, no ___.","answers":["problem"],"hint":"masalah","exp":"no problem.","k":"4f9edfa8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf, saya tidak bisa membantu sekarang.","q":"I'm ___, I can't help right now.","answers":["sorry","afraid"],"hint":"maaf","exp":"sorry.","k":"a88afc63"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Permintaan yang paling sopan:","options":["Would you mind opening the door?",